; SuiteCommands.inix -- the Homer Suite command manifest: every command of DbDo,
; EdSharp, FileDir and HomerView, with its stable identifier, its recommended
; keys, and the status of any change. help\HomerSuite.md explains it.
;
; GENERATED for kit 1.73.0 from the four apps' sources of 17 October 2026 and
; the fifth-round plan. Counts here are source-derived; an app's own
; /exportkeys file, read by scripts\checkKeys, is what proves its keys.
;
; status: current (no change), proposed (both AIs agree; awaiting its stage),
;   ruled (follows a ruling of yours), implemented, verified.
;
; shared: the SuiteCommands method in exec\CSharp\Mdi.cs that the command runs
;   (kit 1.74.0). scripts\checkKeys fails when the method is missing, or, on an
;   app's push, when the app's source does not call it.

[Suite]
schema=1
apps=DbDo, EdSharp, FileDir, HomerView
; conversionsMoved: apps that convert files only through the kit's Conversion
; (1.74.0); the shared check fails on private conversion code in these.
conversionsMoved=DbDo, EdSharp, FileDir

